---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/site';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy: Stranger Than Heaven Tracker"
  description="What this site stores and what it does not. No accounts, no tracking scripts, and tracker progress that stays in your own browser."
  path="/privacy/"
>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p class="lede">Short version: the site does not ask who you are and does not track you.</p>

  <div class="prose">
    <h2>What is stored on your device</h2>
    <p>
      The achievement tracker and the launch checklist save your ticks, and your choice about showing hidden names, in
      your browser's local storage so they are still there when you come back. That data never leaves your device.
      "Clear all ticks" removes the ticks, and clearing your browser data removes everything.
    </p>

    <h2>What the site does not do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>No accounts, logins or forms.</li>
      <li>No analytics or advertising scripts at the moment.</li>
      <li>No cookies set by this site.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>
      Pages are served by Cloudflare. Like any web host, Cloudflare processes technical request data such as IP
      address and browser type in order to deliver pages and protect against abuse. See
      <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a> for how it handles that data.
    </p>

    <h2>If you email us</h2>
    <p>We receive your email address and whatever you write. It is used only to deal with your message.</p>

    <h2>If this changes</h2>
    <p>
      If analytics or advertising are added later, this page will be updated first to say what is used, what it
      collects and how to opt out where that applies.
    </p>

    <p class="small muted">Last updated {site.updated}.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
